<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings reaffirms KNP BT Buy.</title>
<headline>ING Barings reaffirms KNP BT Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Oct 2 research note.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector----------Price---Broker----------</p>
<p>    KNP BT	    Paper/packaging 40.00   ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (reiterated). KNP BT decision to reduce involvement in fine paper and focus on distribution and corrugated board activities means it should become less cyclical and less capital intensive. Strategy is certainly the right one for the long term, although timing is bad. Investors expected to focus on the bad news from the paper industry for the short term, but Buy recommendation retained, based on a 12-month horizon.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		   1.90     unch     21.1	1.00</p>
<p>    1997		   4.90     unch	8.2	1.75</p>
<p>    1998		   5.35     unch	7.5	2.15</p>
